-attendance-layer .shift-results button:hover,.dtr-attendance-layer .shift-results button.selected{background:#eaf1ff}.dtr-attendance-layer .shift-results span{display:block;margin-top:3px;color:#61738f;font-size:12px}.dtr-attendance-layer .shift-results p{padding:0 12px;color:#64738d}.dtr-attendance-layer .selected-shift{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;background:#eaf1ff;color:#1f4aa2!important}
